 void Geolocation::StopUpdating() {
+  // geo-ii: kill any queued synthesized re-fire. StopUpdating is the common exit
+  // (clearWatch with no listeners, tab hide via PageVisibilityChanged,
+  // ContextDestroyed), so cancelling here stops the chain and prevents a stray
+  // delivery to a cleared watch or a torn-down context.
